WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.192
Hi! Today we go to the doctor.

2
00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:10.152
You also learn the imperative with Sie.

3
00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:15.523
You hear these words at the practice:

4
00:00:15.923 --> 00:00:18.163
I have a fever.

5
00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:21.139
I have a cough.

6
00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:23.899
I have a cold.

7
00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:27.187
Take the tablets.

8
00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:30.451
Here's the prescription.

9
00:00:30.851 --> 00:00:34.675
You get the tablets at the pharmacy.

10
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:43.119
The doctor asks: since when have you been ill? You answer with seit:

11
00:00:43.519 --> 00:00:46.023
For three days.

12
00:00:46.423 --> 00:00:49.263
Or: since yesterday.

13
00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:58.007
The doctor tells you what to do. The verb comes first, then Sie:

14
00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:01.127
Drink lots of tea!

15
00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.887
Stay in bed!

16
00:01:04.287 --> 00:01:07.127
Take the tablets!

17
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:15.105
Very important: in an emergency you call one, one, two.

18
00:01:15.505 --> 00:01:18.705
One, one, two.

19
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:24.200
Listen: Mateo is at the doctor's.

20
00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.152
What's the matter?

21
00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:30.440
I have a cough and a fever.

22
00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.680
Since when?

23
00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.656
For two days.

24
00:01:37.056 --> 00:01:39.416
Stay in bed!

25
00:01:39.816 --> 00:01:42.536
Drink lots of tea!

26
00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:53.985
Now you! You're at the doctor's. What's wrong? Since when? What hurts?

27
00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:09.836
Great! Now you can:

28
00:02:10.236 --> 00:02:16.628
You talk to the doctor and understand the advice. Get well soon!

29
00:02:17.028 --> 00:02:19.148
See you soon!
